SUMMARY:Annual March on Musikfest Hike 
DESCRIPTION:Metrotrails: NJ\, PA\, NY Metropolitan Area Hiking and More!\n
 join us for our annual March on Musikfest hike\, and event we have been ha
 ving for 26 years!\nOne would think that after so much time\, we would hav
 e exhausted every way we could walk into this event\, but this time we've 
 found some more interesting stuff we've never done before!\nThis year\, we
  will approach from the Southeast. our route will take us first along a pl
 easant preserve full of field Trails\, and then along some pleasant back r
 oads that are narrower than some of the trails we use. We will then get on
  another Greenway and make our way into hellertown. we will take a familia
 r trip North on the saucon rail trail\, check out the Thomas Ironworks sit
 e again\, and then other Trails as we continue to the north into Saucon Pa
 rk.\nWill continue to a new connecting trail in this area\, and then mic o
 ur way back to the north Bethlehem. We will meander through the fest and t
 hen make our way North to where we met.\nif needed\, contact me at 908-343
 -8374
